{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45677","headline":"上顾大夫 · 贯休","name":"上顾大夫","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"碧海漾仙洲，骊珠外无宝。\n一岳倚青冥，羣山尽如草。\n君侯圣朝瑞，动只关玄造。\n谁云倚天剑，含霜在怀抱。\n谁云青云险，门前是平道。\n洪民亦何幸，里巷清如扫。\n至化无经纶，至神无祝祷。\n即应炳文柄，孤平去浩浩。\n即应调鼎味，比屋堪封保。\n野人慕正化，来自海边岛。\n经传髻里珠，诗学池中藻。\n闭门十余载，庭杉共枯槁。\n今朝投至鉴，得不倾肝脑。\n斯文如未精，归山更探讨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45677.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45677","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}